# Overview invite page — frozen for client (Aug 2026)

The production invite at `https://onwardair.unit311central.com/overview` is **client-approved**. Treat it as locked unless the user explicitly asks to change it in chat.

## Do not change without explicit sign-off

- Left column: 3 boxes (Questions → 45 min session → KEY HIGHLIGHTS), order, sizes, copy
- `defaultOverviewStyleConfig()` / `defaultOnwardAirOverviewContent()` in `overview-style.ts` and `overview-demo.ts`
- Responsive CSS in `OnwardAirOverviewPage.tsx` (media queries, grid/flex left column)
- Overview embed nav row height in `EnterprisePlatformSidebar.tsx` (`OVERVIEW_EMBED_*` constants)
- Edit mode defaults: **off** for clients (`?tune=1` only for internal editing)

## Safe changes (when needed)

- Auth / security / login gate fixes that do not alter visible layout
- Bug fixes that restore the approved snapshot (run `npm run prove:overview-client` first)

## Before any overview layout/style change

1. Ask or confirm the user wants to break the client freeze
2. Run `npm run prove:overview-client` and keep it passing
3. Update `OVERVIEW_CLIENT_LAYOUT_FINGERPRINT` in `overview-style.ts` only with owner approval

## Client URL (share this)

`https://onwardair.unit311central.com/overview` — no query params. Requires login.
